  "releaseNotes": "This update makes MetaMask smoother and more reliable across trading, cards, and account management. Perps and Predict now offer clearer order details and improved controls, while Card, Money, and Earn flows are easier and more reliable to use. We\u2019ve also improved link and QR code handling, refined the experience across the app, and fixed issues affecting messages, transaction details, settings, and activity.",
