  "description": "MetaMask is the world's most secure and flexible crypto wallet, trusted by over 100 million users. Trade, buy, sell, spend, and explore across every major blockchain network. MetaMask puts you in full control of your assets and your trades with complete self-custody.\n\nSPEND CRYPTO WITH METAMASK CARD \n\u2013\u00a0Spend crypto in the real world with MetaMask Card\u2028\n\u2013\u00a0Earn cashback with every purchase \u2028\n\u2013\u00a0Get exclusive cardholder benefits\u2013dining, travel, crypto, and more\u2028\n\u2013\u00a0Spend directly from your wallet at 150+ million merchants\n\nTRADE CRYPTO, STOCKS, PERPS, PREDICTION MARKETS & MORE \u2028\n\u2013 Trade, buy, sell, and swap hundreds of thousands of tokens instantly \n\u2013\u00a0One app for every major blockchain network\u2014Ethereum, Bitcoin, Solana, and more\u2028\n\u2013 Trade perpetual futures with up to 50x leverage\u2028\n\u2013 Trade 260+ real-world stocks and funds \u2028\n\u2013 Trade on real-world events with prediction markets \u2028\n\u2013 Put your assets to work with staking and DeFi lending\n\nINDUSTRY-LEADING SECURITY \u2028\n\u2013 Self-custody: you hold your private keys, and control your assets \u2028\n\u2013 Transaction previews show exactly what you're signing before you confirm \u2028\n\u2013 Live threat surveillance monitors and protects your wallet 24/7 \u2028\n\u2013 MEV and front-running protection is built in \u2028\n\u2013 Privacy-first design\u2014you control what you share\u2028\n\nEXPLORE THE DECENTRALIZED WEB \u2028\n\u2013 Connect to thousands of decentralized apps across every major network \u2028\n\u2013 Discover DeFi protocols, meme coins, NFTs, and web3 gaming \u2028\n\nCRYPTO MADE EASY \u2028\n\u2013 Easy for beginners to get started, with pro trading tools ready when you are \u2028\n\u2013 Trade directly inside your wallet, no need to transfer to an exchange \u2028\n\u2013 Social login and device sync for quick setup \u2028\u2013 Network fees included in your swap quotes\u2028\n\n24/7 LIVE SUPPORT \u2028\n\u2013 Real humans and expert customer service, available around the clock \u2028\n\u2013 Get help when you need it from our world-class support team\u2028\n\nSUPPORTED NETWORKS: \u2028\nEthereum, Bitcoin, Solana, Linea, BSC, ZkSync, Base, Arbitrum, Avalanche, Polygon, Optimism, Sei, Monad, TRON, and more.\u2028\n\nSUPPORTED TOKENS: \u2028\nEther (ETH), Bitcoin (BTC), Solana (SOL), USD Coin (USDC), Tether (USDT), MetaMask USD (mUSD), Wrapped Bitcoin (wBTC), XRP, Cardano (ADA), Shiba Inu (SHIB), Pepe (PEPE), Dogecoin (DOGE), Dai (DAI), and hundreds of thousands more.\u2028\n\nJoin 100 million users who already trade crypto with MetaMask. \nDownload now!",
